	(text "U4: TPS43061 shares the TPS43060 pinout and symbol. EN is left open, which the data sheet says enables the part through its internal pull-up.\nR30: Power law fit through the data sheet's characterised points (115k gives 500 kHz, 75k gives 750 kHz). Confirm against its Equation 14.\nL3: XGL6060 shares the 6 x 6 mm body of the XAL6060 whose land pattern is used; confirm against the XGL6060 drawing.\nC24 100nF: VIN pin bypass. Data sheet asks for 0.1 uF or more\nC25 1uF: VCC decoupling. Data sheet range 0.47 to 10 uF\nC26 100nF: Bootstrap capacitor, 0.1 uF as in the data sheet example\nC27 47nF: Soft start. t = C * 1.22 V / 5 uA = 11 ms\nR30 147k: Frequency set, 400 kHz\nR31 10k: PGOOD pull-up to VCC, 10k as the data sheet recommends"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 223.52 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e1197688-9ffa-5b6b-a077-93a020cdb79c")
	)
